    {
      "content": "Managed:\nNSW Telco Authority\nPrimary contact:\nDhara Krunal Modi\ndhara.modi@customerservice.nsw.gov.au\nType:\nRFT\n(Open)\nCategory(s):\nInformation and technology\nInformation and technology - Infrastructure and network\nInformation and technology - Managed and outsourced services\nOpportunity ID:\nRFT-2015917\nLocations:\nAll regions\nCovered procurement:\nNo\nMulti agency use:\nNo\nRelated opportunities:\nNone\nEstimated timeframe for delivery:\nPublish date:\n17-Aug-2026\nClose date:\n11-Sep-2026 3:00 PM\nCompletion date:\n31-Mar-2027\nEstimated decision date:\n30-Oct-2026",
      "heading": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "content": "The NSWTA Site Deployment will provide the required network switching, firewall/security, software support and professional services to support site establishment, resilience, and operational continuity. The solution provides a scalable design aligned to SOCI, Essential Eight, ISO 27001 and NIST requirements.",
      "heading": "Project goals"
    },
    {
      "content": "NSW Telco Authority requires a supplier to supply, delivery, and implementation of Cisco network switching hardware, software and support, Palo Alto Networks firewall/security hardware, software and support, and the associated professional services required to install, configure, and migrate this scope, to support the NSWTA Site Deployment.\nPart E - Scope fo Work, defines the all requirements that a successful respondent must meet in responding to this engagement.",
      "heading": "Scope"
    },
    {
      "content": "Please submit dully filled response documents as per below:\nPart B - Request for Tender Returnable Schedules\nPart C.1_Core and Combined Solution contract\nPart D - Pricing Schedule",
      "heading": "Additional details/instructions"
    },
    {
      "content": "### Mandatory requirements\n1. #### Modern slavery *\n**Information and technology - Infrastructure and network**\nThis procurement category has a heightened risk of modern slavery.\nYou will be asked to provide information about modern slavery risks in your business and any actions you have taken to address these. You can visit the NSW Anti-slavery Commissioner’s GRS webpage for more information.\nDo you agree to provide this information?\n**Response type**\nCheckbox (Agree)\n2. #### Scheme membership (SCM0020) *\n**Information and technology**\nThis procurement category has a mandated scheme.\nThis category has a mandated scheme, to be awarded this contract you may need to be a member of the ICT Services Scheme SCM0020.\nAre you a member of SCM0020?\n**Response type**\nRadio button (Yes/No)\n### Opportunity requirements\n**1.**\n**RFT-2015917 Tender Documents**\nPart A_Request for Tender_Conditions\nPart B_Request for Tender_Returnable Schedules\nPart C_Conditions of Contract\nPart C.1_Core and Combined Solution contract\nPart D - Pricing Schedule\nPart E - Statement of Requirements\n**Response type**\nFile upload (Multiple)",
      "heading": "Requirements"
    },
    {
      "content": "### Assessment Criteria\nGeneral assessment criteria that was used to evaluate this opportunity\n- Capability\n- Methodology\n- Experience\n- Price\n- Compliance",
      "heading": "Evaluation"
    },
